Z||000000||GT GT 87||03-20-2001||09:07 PM||||Some times the check engie lite comes on and stay on , some times it just flashes,,,, hard code soft code.I found a great switch that mounts in the lighter hole, to hard wire to the ALCL termanl. So all you have to do , to check codes, or to time your engine is to flip a switch .  I know it's not needed often ,but I don't smoke, and my car likes to set codes. It is a radioshack switch-----#275-730 Rockerswitch..... It fits perfectly in the hole for the lighter. Perhaps you have another reason for a switch????????????? It looks great                Steve||||reg||1
